<odoo>
<!--
    Stage templates are linked to hr.department records which are
    company-specific and therefore cannot be pre-created in module data.

    To create stage templates for your departments:
      1. Open Configuration > Stage Templates
      2. Create records and link each to the relevant hr.department
    OR use the "Create Default Stages" smart button on any helpdesk team
    form – this auto-generates a stage set based on the department name.
-->
</odoo>
